OCATIONS. THE UAPs DID NOT\nHINDER THE MISSION. WSV IS ATTACHED BELOW\n\n\n        WEATHER\n\n   • Weather:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                              3.5C. (B)(6)\n\nDECLASSIFED                SECRET//REL TO USA, FVEY\n                                UNCLASSIFIED", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "4e9516f3cd2a68ec7027d6946da9483bcb1a7eac911ecc2241c859bcfe843b2f", "output_sha256": "5184fa777d852d7c4a2f513fa237794434736bc76acc818e6ac979a052f3e404", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T18:14:32.743112+00:00"}, {"id": "c1c59236394f7b14-p1", "card_id": "c1c59236394f7b14", "page": 1, "title": "DOW-UAP-PR019, Unresolved UAP Report, Middle East, May 2022", "text": "Declassified by MG Richard A. Harrison\nUSCENTCOM Chief of Staff\nDeclassified on: 7 October 2025\n\nSECRET//REL TO USA, FVEY\n\nMisrep undefined-7473483\n\nNarrative\n\n(SECRET//REL TO USA, FVEY) AT 0246Z, 1.4a TOOK OFF FROM 1.4a\nAT 0253Z, 1.4a HANDED OVER WITH THE LRE WITH FULLY MISSION CAPABLE SENSORS.\nAT 0958Z, 1.4a BEGAN SIGINT COLLECTION.\n\nFROM 0958Z TO 2036Z, 1.4a CONDUCTED TARGET DEVELOPMENT ON OP 1.4a\nISO 1.4a SEE ISR 1).\nAT 1514Z, 1.4a OBSERVED 1X UAP (SEE OBSERVATION 1).\n\nAT 2036Z, RETURNED TO BASE.\nAT 2036Z, 1.4a STOPPED SIGINT COLLECTION.\nAT 2257Z, HANDED BACK TO THE LRE.\n\nFULL MOTION VIDEO WAS EXPLOITED BY DGS1.\n\nAT 0004Z, 1.4a LANDED AT 1.4a WITH A LAST ENGINE SHUT-DOWN TIME OF 0014Z.\n\n1.4a 1 IMINT TASKING PROSECUTED, 1.4a\nHOURS, 1 SIGINT TASKING PROSECUTED, 2 TOTAL TASKINGS PROSECUTED; 1\nOBSERVATION\n\n\n(S/REL IDO) Mission Narrative\n\n\nAdmin\n\n\nCLASSIFICATION\n\n• Classification: SECRET\n• Associated Caveats: REL TO USA, FVEY\n• Classification Source (MS or Classification Guide ID): MS\n• Declassification Date (YYYYMMDD): 20470506\n\nOPERATION\n\n(b)(6)\n\nSECRET//REL TO USA, FVEY\nUSCENTCOM MDR 25-0093 / JS-250710-TM8S                                    10/20/25  001\nApp