 AT 1515Z, [1.4a] HANDED OVER FROM\nTHE LRE. [1.4a] PROCEEDED TO FRAGGED TASKING TO SUPPORT DATA MASKED.\n\nAT 1618Z, [1.4a] WAS 7-LINED TO SUPPORT DATA MASKED. [1.4a] ARRIVED ON-STATION AT\n2018Z, CHECKED IN WITH DATA MASKED, AND PERFORMED FMV/SIGINT COLLECTION AT\n36S YC 40[1.4a] 57[1.4a] (SEE ISR 1).\n\nAT 0811Z, [1.4a] OBSERVED 1X POSS UAP (SEE UAP 1).\n\nAT 0542Z, [1.4a] RETURNED TO BASE. AT 1035Z, [1.4a] HANDED BACK TO THE LRE. AT 1105Z,\n[1.4a] LANDED AT LGLR. FULL MOTION VIDEO WAS EXPLOITED BY GET. 20:01 MISSION\nHOURS, 09:24 FMV HOURS, 1X FMV TASKINGS PROSECUTED.\n[REDACTED]\n\n[REDACTED] Mission Narrative\n\n\nAdmin\n\nCLASSIFICATION\n\n• Classification: [REDACTED]\n• Associated Caveats: [REDACTED]\n• Classification Source (MS or Classification Guide ID): MS\n• Declassification Date (YYYYMMDD): 20481028\n\nOPERATION\n\n• Operation: [1.4a]\n• Domain: AIR\n• Operations Center: 603rd\n• Major Command (MAJCOM): AFSOC\n• Combatant Command (COCOM): USCENTCOM\n\n3.5c, (b)(6)\n\nUSCENTCOM MDR 26-0019          Approved for Release to AARO[REDACTED]          01/26/26 001", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "ede59a7f72009702671d7f6472a4e24224438d65e3cb2d1f39be9ddfce16334b", "output_sha256": "ede59a7f72009702671d7f6472a4e24224438d65e3cb2d1f39be9ddfce16334b", "generated_at": "2026-05-22T19:20:27.790919+00:00"}, {"id": "c788c17e8cc32230-p2", "card_id": "c788c17e8cc32230", "page": 2, "title": "DOW-UAP-PR035, Unresolved UAP Report, Greece, October 2023", "text": "Declassified by MG Richard A. Harrison\nUSCENTCOM Chief of Staff\nDeclassified on: 22 January 2026\n\n[REDACTED]\n\nMSGID\n\n• Report Type: MISREP\n• Originator (Unit or Squadron): 33 SOS\n• Submit Date:\n\nMSNID\n\n• Tasking Order (ATO): 1.4a\n• Mission Type: ISR\n• ATO Mission Number: 1.4a\n• Country Tasked: US - UNITED STATES\n• Service Tasked: A - AIR FORCE\n\nPOC\n\n• Rank: A1C\n• Full Name: 3.5c, (b)(