sons listed below who were    tablishing a bona-fide residence. (If any of these be other than a\nmy dependents on the effective date of applicable orders or other    lawful wife or unmarried legitimate child under 21 years of age of\nauthority; such travel was actually performed with the intent of es-    a MALE member, complete appropriate certificate on reverse.)\n\nNAME                                    RELATIONSHIP            BIRTH DATES OF CHILDREN\n\nNorma Isobel NEWHOUSE                   wife\nDelbert G. NEWHOUSE                     son                     6-28-38\nAnne Lisbet NEWHOUSE                    daughter                3-14-40\n\nLOCATION OF DEPENDENTS (On date of receipt of orders/authority - street address, city, state)       DATE OF DEPARTURE\nDESIGNATED Location, Almador, Clackamas, Portland, Oregon                                           Jul 25 ARRIVAL\n\n736 Lakewood Road, Warrington, Fla.                             8-2-56\n\nNOTE: When travel is from other than vicinity of the old station or to other than vicinity of the new station, explain circumstances on the reverse.\n\nKIND (Rail, air, etc: If none, so state)\n\nPLACE OF DEPARTURE              (Date)              DESTINATION                              (Date of arrival)\n                                                    Warrington, Florida (Cert.) Date\n\nTRAVEL COVERED BY THIS CLAIM REPRESENTS ENTIRE TRAVEL OF ALL MY DEPENDENTS ON THIS CHANGE OF STATION EXCEPT:\nDELBERT NEWHOUSE - SEE ATTACHED\n\nPENALTY FOR PRESENTING FRAUDULENT CLAIM — Fine        FORFEITURE OF FRAUDULENT CLAIM — Falsification of an\nof not more than $10,000 or imprisonment for not more than    Item in an expense account works a forfeiture of the claim.\n5 years or both. Title 18, U.S.C. 287; Id. 1001.             Title 28, U.S.C. 2514.\n\nSIGN    I CERTIFY, that this voucher and attachments are correct and just in all respects and that\nORIGINAL    payment therefor has not been received. No prior claim has been presented by me or any\nONLY    member of my family for the travel of dependents as claimed herein.\n\nSIGNATURE OF PAYEE: D.C. Newhouse                          DATE:\nAUTHORIZED ALLOWANCE (From DELBERT G. NEWHOUSE)          (To)              APPROVED FOR\n\nMILEAGE Florida, Oregon                    Warrington, Florida                              $\nPursuant to authority vested in me, I certify this voucher to be correct and proper for payment.    444.00\n\nAUTHORIZED CER-\nTIFYING OFFICER:                                                                    DATE:\n                W E DODDY, ACCOUNTING CLASSIFICATION:                            6-3-56\n\nAppropriation Symbol    Object    Expenditure    Chargeable    Bureau Control    Bureau Con-\nand Subhead             Class     Account        Activity      Activity No.      trol No.         Amount\n\n17  1453.18  MPN        029       MC CC 61-16            22       61600\nPAID BY CHECK           PAID BY CASH          SIGNATURE OF PAYEE *(Required for cash payment only)\nCheck number:           Amount $              D.C. Newhouse\nDate of check:          Date paid: 444.00\n\nDD  1 APR 54  766  REPLACES NAV. S. AND A FORMS 227, 74-513,   MEMORANDUM COPY\n              NAVSO-107, NAVMC-179-80 & 4779-20              Form Approved by\n                                                             Comptroller General, U.S.\n                                                             March 15, 1954", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "679c1e4adde9718d16e7f6ac3361cc208fd880f07a4a5fffda74e0d2a01a64dc", "output_sha256": "6bf67d3d392b98cd3917fd9db8f72082edfe438c417ff65cecd838bc03b6f267", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:28:16.154065+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p8", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 8, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "DATA SHEET TO ACCOMPANY CLAIM FOR\nREIMBURSEMENT FOR DEPENDENTS' TRAVEL\n(All entries to be made by the claimant in his own handwriting)\n\nThe following data is submitted in substantiation of my claim for reimbursement for travel performed by my dependents:\n\nMEMBER'S FULL NAME  Delbert  Clement  Newhouse  177283  CWO-4\n                    (First)  (Middle)   (Last)   (Service number)  (Rank/rate)\n\nADDRESS TO WHICH CHECK IS TO BE MAILED: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWIFE'S NAME:  Dorma Isobel Newhouse\n\n*CHILDREN'S NAMES:                    RELATIONSHIP           DATE OF BIRTH\n\n     Delbert Carroll Newhouse  Son                           6/28/38\n     Anne Lisbet Newhouse  Daughter                          3/14/40\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n*Step children or adopted children must be classified as such.  Dependent parent must be classified and claimed as such.\n\n\"I certify that my dependents were located at (Street address, city, and State) 3581 SE Grant Court,\nPortland, Oregon                    when orders directing detachment from my old permanent station\nwere received and departed that place on (Date) 2/19/56          ; and arrived at (Street address, city, and\nState) 736 Lakewood Rd., Warrington, Florida          , on (Date) 8/2/56          ;\nthat such travel was performed at my own expense, and that the travel covered by this claim represents the entire travel\nof all my dependents which has been or will be made on this change of station except as follows: (Exception, if any)\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIf orders direct my travel overseas where dependents are not permitted to go, I HEREBY DESIGNATE (Street ad-\n\ndress, city, and State) ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nas point to which transportation of dependents is desired.\n\nI certify that my dependents were last transported or reimbursed at Government expense for travel to ------------------\n\n     Portland, Oregon                                                                                                    \"\n\nNOTE.—This data sheet is to be presented to the disbursing officer with the original and three certified copies of travel\n     orders, with all endorsements.  The \"Voucher for Reimbursement for Expenses Incident to Dependent Travel\"\n     (NAV. S. AND A. FORM 912 Rev.) will be signed when completely filled in.  This \"Data Sheet\" or the \"Voucher\n     for Reimbursement for Expenses Incident to Dependents Travel\" (NAV. S. AND A. FORM 912 Rev.) will not be\n     signed in blank.\n     \"I further certify that all entries made above are in my own handwriting and are true and correct; that I have\nread this completed data sheet and understand that any misrepresentation or concealment of material fact by me\nmay work a forfeiture of the claim and subject me to trial by court martial or Federal District court and to penal-\nties extending to 5 years imprisonment or $10,000 fine, or both.\"\n\n                                                        Newhouse\n                                                   (Signature of Claimant)\n\nNAV. S. AND A. FORM 915 (4-53)\n                              U. S. GOVERNMENT PRINTING OFFICE   16—OS710-1", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "71fad204faf75410c5abc50d6e7b0950ada1d741e577cf9a69a03cd807ec3d15", "output_sha256": "53f2c597771bbed7faa794260d07948