mber\" should be\nentered if possible, since this information will assist in expediting action by the insurance company should a claim become payable.)\n\n12.          FULL NAME OF COMPANY                                               ADDRESS OF HOME OFFICE                              POLICY NO.\n\n\n\n                                                       (Continue on reverse side)\n\nIN THE EVENT THAT I AM LISTED AS MISSING, OR BY OTHER MILITARY CIRCUMSTANCE AM UNABLE TO TRANSMIT FUNDS TO\nMY DEPENDENTS, IT IS MY DESIRE THAT\n\n13. FIRST NAME—MIDDLE NAME—LAST NAME                                                                                   RELATIONSHIP\nNorma Isabel Newhouse                                                                                                   Wife\n\nADDRESS (Number, street, city, zone, and State)                                                                        RECEIVE EACH MONTH\n8623 Piney Branch Road, Silver Spring, Md.                                                                             100    % OF MY PAY.\n\nMILITARY ADDRESS                                       DATE SIGNED              SIGNATURE OF DESIGNATOR\nNSC, Oakland, Calif.                                   2/6/52                   [Signature: Newhouse]\n\nDD   FORM  93   REPLACES NME FORM 93,  1 OCT 48: NAVMC 118 (15 PD): NAVPERS 601, PAGES 7 AND 8: AND NCG 2529, WHICH          16-61480-1\n1 JAN 50        MAY BE USED UNTIL 1 JANUARY 1951, WHEN THEY WILL ALL BECOME OBSOLETE.", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "161c88fcc97ce3cceb175a2c7e00b5326443e7814344772a14f3e24b953ae990", "output_sha256": "7a1940709960bbaa77a7baef2bf7e28620feff81067ac628e9ba1b94530cb5b1", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:29:57.703544+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p40", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 40, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Del