 government transportation is directed outside the United States.\nClass TWO priority is certified for travel via government aircraft.\n\n4. Cost of travel is chargeable to 1741453.18, MPN 1954, object class 029,\nexpenditure account 74120, Bureau Control 22/31600.\n\n5. Upon reporting, forward to BuPers a copy of these orders (Staff Corps Officers\nan additional copy to cognizant Bureau) via new commanding officer with all endorsements. Where leave or delay is involved, keep old and new station advised of\naddress using Form NavPers 3036.\n\nCopy to:\nOP 54\nCOMAIRPAC CODE 61\nCOMUTWINGPAC\nCO UTRON FIVE\nCOMTWELVE\nCOMNAVBASE SFRAN\nCOMSERVPAC (3)                                    J. L. HOLLOWAY, JR.\nJacket copy    \"QUAL\"\nPers-B111s     784162\n    E111a      161254\n    B11183\n    B115c\n    B31\n\n                                                  20098", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "4f057e7acab7bd12c212ceeb7ed2587b3f7af968c5ad5e2e87f81fdb5877709b", "output_sha256": "7dc4774824f12d07a40e06694b56c36a919c435ac029bbad5780b1e0a9d3d848", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:31:35.709524+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p72", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 72, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "Op-541E2/ahp  2-23-54\nOFFICER'S ORDER MEMORANDUM\nTO: BUPERS (ATT. PERS: B115)\n\n                          OPNAV FORM - 1321-1 (REV. 2-52)\n\n                                                    25 FEB 1954\n\nIt is requested that the below named person be issued orders as indicated:\nRANK  NAME (First)         (Middle Initial)    (Last)           CORPS    FILE NO. & DESIGNATOR OR CLASS\n\nCHPHOT   Delbert         C.    NEWHOUSE                  [X]USN    177283/8311 V\n                                                          □ USNR\nAT      Naval Supply Center                               D