ications thereto, you are directed to forward to the Chief\nof Naval Personnel via your new commanding officer, a copy of these\norders complete with all endorsements thereto, including the final\nreporting endorsement (staff corps officers an additional copy to\ncognizant Bureau).\n\n3.  Delivered this date.\n\n                              W. T. RASSIEUR\n\n\n                              J. M. ST. ONGE\n                              By direction\n\nCopy to:\nCOMFLEETACT JAPAN-KOREAN\nCOMFAIR JAP\nCOMNAVFE\nCOMNAB FOURTEEN\nCOMFOURTEEN\nCOMSERVPAC", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "a216f8b77e1e0b141d4caf0693ee5a3f3b5e8a762e1e1f4cc95a85d0647f5feb", "output_sha256": "a13ccbeeb178887274769e04c4c2a6f21280ab04b5c8b0cd81ccb2783b800d54", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:33:23.009192+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p106", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 106, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "m073\n\nDRAFTED BY                    FILE NR.              ROOM          EXT. NR.\nPERS-B115j-MLJ-1    [REDACTED]   177283/8311           [REDACTED]        42804\nRELEASED BY                   CODE/SECT. NR.        DATE\nCAPT E A HANNEGAN                                   26 APR 1951 1540\n\n                    Please leave this space clear\n\n                                                              B115J\n                                                              Beyth\n\nFROM: BUPERS WASHDC              261953                PRECEDENCE\n                                (date/time) (GCT)\nTO:              NAS BARBERS POINT TH                 □ PRIORITY\n\n                                                      □ ROUTINE\nINFO:            COMFLEACT JAPAN-KOREA\n                 COMFAIRJAPAN                         □ DEFERRED\n                 COMNAVFE\n                 COMNAB FOURTEENTHNAVDIST      