y appointment.\n\nCC:\nCNO (OP-54).                              J. W. ROPER\nCO., Nav Photographic Cen.,\n NAS, Wash., D. C.\nComPRNC.\n                                          017761\n\n                    \"QUAL\"\nJacket copy——       124556\nPers-311s           161270\n    311s4           148200\n    3118-F\n    82212       Upon reporting, forward to BuPers a\n    31B14       copy of these orders, (Staff Corps\n    321         Officers an additional copy to\n    311G        cognizant Bureau) via new Command-\n                ing officer with all endorsements.", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "18e1b1fdb1ddd715cd4061fa1a3e8e2a1441e82873dd3cd18381ad95f4153d15", "output_sha256": "27b232c516c2fc13c0b54f2e21f17d5a9ec1fe0280dfc56d6006749b64e5ece9", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:34:19.938888+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p121", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 121, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "Op-541C5/wjl\nOFFICER'S ORDER MEMORANDUM          OPNAV-54-109  REV. 8-48\nTO: BU PERS (Att. Pers: 3116)                              25 NOV 1949\n1. It is requested that the below named person be issued orders as indicated:\n\nFILE NO. — DESIGNATOR        NAME  (last)           (first)      (middle-initial)    RANK           [X] U.S.N.\n  177 283/8311 350            NEWHOUSE             Delbert        E.              CnPhoto         [  ] U.S.N.R.\n\n[  ] FIRST ORDERS          [  ] CHANGE OF DUTY          [  ] APPROVAL OF ACTION              [  ] CONFIRMING\n\n[  ] ORDERS OF_______     [  ] UNEXECUTED PORTION                          [  ] STUDENT              L    PLAIN\n                                ORDERS OF________                               AVIATOR CLAUSE    T    [X]\n[  ] LETTER               [  ] DISPATCH__________                          [  ] FLYING CLAUSE    R.   AIR\n        