 Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "17,283/1350\nPers-3118-MES-2\n\n31 March 1949\n\nFrom:           The Chief of Naval Personnel.\nTo:             LT Delbert C. NEWHOUSE, USN,\n                Office of Bureau of Aeronautics General\n                Representative, Central District,\n                Wright-Patterson Air Force Base,\n                Dayton, Ohio.\n\nVia:            Bureau of Aeronautics General Representative,\n                Central District.\n\nSubject:        Temporary additional duty.\n\n1. On or about 19 April 1949 you will proceed to Washington, D.C.,\nand report to the Chief of the Bureau of Aeronautics, Navy Department,\nfor temporary duty to attend a conference.\n\n2. This is in addition to your present duties and upon the completion\nthereof you will return to Dayton, Ohio, and resume your regular\nduties.\n\n3. Travel by government air is directed where available. For travel\nby naval transport aircraft, Class Three priority is hereby certified.\n\n4. You will be reimbursed on a per diem basis while absent from your\nstation in accordance with Par. 4153, NTT.\n\n\n\nENCL: (HW)                              T. L. SPRAGUE\n  A. Housing Info\n\nCC:\nBuAer\nJacket Copy\nPers-3118\nPers-3118                               T-5092\nPers-3118-F(Aer)\nPers-316", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "b92fafe53c6fa3aa54665163f9aba8f746db123487d0a50af1c0741274f0565d", "output_sha256": "2d980207cd3cce2f404945d8224f9077de649bb7b88d3e8a0f75670c45c8220b", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:36:00.609249+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p160", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 160, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "TEMPORARY TRAVEL ORDER REQ[REDACTED]  VIA BAGR CD\nNAVPERS-1863 (REV. 8-48)\n\nTO:  The Chief of Naval Personnel.                                    DATE  28 March 1949\n\