e United States\non September 1, 1942 to the rank of Photographer, USN for tem-\nporary service to rank from June 15, 1942, in accordance with\nreference (b).\n\n2. I have this date accepted this appointment.\n\n\n                              Delbert C. Newhouse\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nFIRST ENDORSEMENT to                    U. S. NAVAL BASE\nPhotographer D. C.                    Santa Elena Bay, Ecuador\nNewhouse, USN to BuPers\nof October 15, 1942                      October 15, 1942\n\nFrom:  The Commanding Officer\nTo:    The Chief of Naval Personnel\n\n1. Forwarded.\n\n\n                              J. R. LITCHFIELD\n\nCertified to be a true copy\n\n[signature]\nD C NEWHOUSE, LT LINE USN", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "b0a67da13c1aa5a5c98bb953f8d849ffa676c8d20e3827d010c5fb98624e04f7", "output_sha256": "8edcb86d600bc61838a3c60fb818e1c4df72bee9080d1a9957f06f10864cae64", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:36:26.723330+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p170", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 170, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "COPY                    COPY                              COPY\n\n                                        U. S. [REDACTED]VAL AIR STATION\n                                        Coco Solo, Upham, C.Z.\nNA10/P17-2/00                           Navy 1955\n                                        c/o Fleet Post Office\n                                        New York, N.Y.\n\n                                        6 July 1943\nFrom:  Ensign Delbert C. Newhouse, U. S. Navy\nTo:    The Chief of Naval Personnel\nVia:   The Commanding Officer\n\nSubj:  Acknowledgment of notice of Temporary Appointment\n\n1.  I hereby acknowledge receipt of notice of my appointment to\nthe rank of Ensign in the regular Navy, for temporary service\nmade by the President on 15 June 1943.\n\n2.  Notice of this temporary appointment was made by my Command-\ning Officer pursuant to the authority contained in BuPers C/L\n96-43.\n\n3.  This temporary appointment has not and will not be declined\nby me.\n\n4.  Two (2) certified copies of this letter are being furnished\nby me to the Disbursing Officer carrying my accounts in order\nthat my pay may be adjusted accordingly.\n\n\n                                        Delbert C. Newhouse\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nNA10/P17-2/00          FIRST ENDORSEMENT     U. S. NAVAL AIR STATION\n                                             Coco Solo, Upham, C.Z.\n                                             Navy 1955\n                                             c/o Fleet Post Office\n                                             New York, N.Y.\n\nFrom:  The Commanding Officer\nTo:    The Chief of Naval Personnel\n\n1.  Forwarded.\n\n                                        R. P. KAUFFMAN\n\nCopy to:  Com15\n                                        Certified to be a true copy\n\n                                        D. C. Newhouse\n\n                                        D. C. NEWHOUSE, LT LINE USN", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "99fd890518e4eb63f45a9073e5732aa42d0579f86daf66020f509aa7255f40c3", "output_sha256": "80cc2e6d28fb3cfe9bfa1723481b37b9fefba224054d143c42c21b5df100c006", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:36:29.228665+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p171", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 171, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "COPY                    COPY                                COPY\n\n          ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF NOTICE OF TEMPORARY APPOINTMENT\n\n                                        Date:  5 SEP 1944\n\nFrom:   Lieut(jg) Delbert Clement NEWHOUSE, USN\nTo:     The Chief of Naval Personnel\nVia:    The Commanding Officer, U. S. Naval Air Station, Coco\n        Solo, C.Z.\n\n1.  I acknowledge receipt of notice of appointment to the rank\nof Lieut.(jg) in the Navy, for temporary service made by the\nPresident on 1 Sept. 1944.\n\n2.  Notice of this temporary appointment was made by my report-\ning senior pursuant to the authority contained in AlNav No. 169.\nMy BuPers file number is 177283.\n\n3.  This temporary appointment has not and will not be declined\nby me.\n\n4.  Two (2) certified copies of this letter are being furnished\nby me to the Disbursing Officer carrying my accounts.\n\n5.  I certify that the appointment to the above rank has not\nbeen previously withheld for any reason.\n\n                                        DELBERT CLEMENT NEWHOUSE\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nFirst Endorsement                       U. S. NAVAL AIR STATION\n                                        COCO SOLO, CANAL ZONE\n\n                                                    5 SEP 1944\nFrom:   The Commanding Officer, U. S. Naval Air Station, Coco Solo,\n        C.Z.\nTo:     The Chief of Naval Personnel\n\n1.  Forwarded.\n\n\n                                        THOMAS DURFEE\ncc:  Two-Disbursing Officer Carrying Accounts\n     One-Officers file jacket\n     One-Officer concerned\n     One-Com15\n\n\n                              Certified to be a true copy:\n\n                              D. C. Newhouse\n                              D C NEWHOUSE, LT LINE USN", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "255ae5c8576269bb2689da5a0aeeb8f64e8f1f9dadd2e98592e0fd8c8e09a435", "output_sha256": "255ae5c8576269bb2689da5a0aeeb8f64e8f1f9dadd2e98592e0fd8c8e09a435", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:36:31.255508+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p172", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff4