ION\n   2060                                 COCO SOLO, CANAL ZONE\n\n                    1st Endorsement   21 OCT 1943\n\nFrom:       The Commanding Officer\nTo:         The Commandant, Fifteenth Naval District\n\n     1.     Forwarded, recommending approval.          3/6\n\n                              R. P. Kauffman\n                              R. P. KAUFFMAN\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n                                        23 October 1943\nEnd-2\nP16-3/00(60)bmm\nFrom:  Com 15\nTo:  √ Bupers\n\n1.    Forwarded recommending approval.\n\n                              S. C. McCORMICK\n                              By direction", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "f7b0c712b330e999c8bafa75d34973c47fcab3fd05670258d5d5c7f5168b78b2", "output_sha256": "3bcbf9e2f77a09f51d65592392dd499b9564a864a1eed3c0a8e146af21c72549", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:46:51.454153+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p423", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 423, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "Prep 2 Nov 1943\n\n                                                    3/6\nPers-316-vmp\n                                NOV 3  1943\nEnd. - 3.\n\nFrom:     BuPers.\nTo:       The Chief of Naval Operations.\n\nSubj:     Request for detail to duty as Aviation Technical\n          Observer - from Ensign Delbert C. Newhouse, USN,\n          (177283).\n\n1.        Forwarded for comment, recommendation and return.\n\nBy direction.\n\n\n                              L. W. Carstensen,\n                              Lieutenant, USNR,\n                              Aviation Detail Office.", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "d6db657f346b4d808f7aeba1d125a9c69990a0f502d6a22c2b12dc0becd3