REV. 3-45)\n\n                    STATEMENT OF TEMPORARY APPOINTMENT\n\nFILE NUMBER  |                NAME                 | CLASS  | APPOINTED TO |\n  1 7 7 2 8 3 | NEWHOUSE  DELBERT  C               | LAP -  | LT           |\nDATE OF APPOINTMENT | DATE OF RANK | CIRC. LTR. | ALNAV. |   NUMBER    |    DATED\n  0 4   0 1   4 6  |  0 4  0 1  4 6 |           |   0    |  1 5 0   4 6| 0 4  0 1  4 6\n\nSubject to the conditions stated below, the above individual was appointed by the President to the rank indicated\nabove, for temporary service.\n\nIn the event all stated conditions be met, the appointment (unless expressly declined) is to be regarded for all purposes\nas having been accepted on the date made, without formal acceptance or oath of office, as provided in Section 5 of an\nAct of Congress approved June 30, 1942, (Public No. 639 — 77th Congress).\n\n\nCONDITIONS UNDER WHICH APPOINTMENT WOULD NOT BE EFFECTED:\n\n    1.    Physical disqualification.\n    2.    Withheld by commanding officer.\n    3.    Declined\n    4.         (a)   Under treatment in hospital;\n               (b)   On sick leave;\n               (c)   Missing;\n               (d)   Prisoner of war.\n\nNOTE:  The effectiveness of this appointment must be verified by other correspondence in the officer's correspondence\n       jacket unless notation appears hereon indicating appointment not effected.\n\n\n\n\n          FINISHED FILE\n        OFFICER PROMOTION\n            SECTION\n\n\n\n\n                    STATEMENT OF TEMPORARY APPOINTMENT", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "08b11f268646b5068a6524db45930a83e5bed3071a6d90f65b49e341b95b1f8c", "output_sha256": "a71be25f310911338d3da63f02aa175428f82904f8a9aa14f8f900979a419256", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:47:04.099414+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p432", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 432, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "3 April 1946          ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF NOTICE OF TEMPORARY APPOINTMENT\n\n      From:       Lieutenant Delbert C. Newhouse, USN 177283\n      To:         The Chief of Naval Personnel\n      Via:        Supply Officer in Command, Naval Aviation Supply Depot, Phila., Pa.\n\n1.          I acknowledge receipt of appointment to the rank of Lieutenant USN\nin the Navy, ([REDACTED] for temporary service made by the President on\n1 April 1946.\n\n2.          Notice of this temporary appointment was made by my reporting\nsenior pursuant to the authority contained in (Alnav No. 150-46    [REDACTED]\n[REDACTED]           ). My BuPers file number is 177283.\n\n3.          This temporary appointment has not and will not be declined by me.\n\n4.          Two (2) certified copies of this letter are being furnished by me\nto the Disbursing Officer carrying my accounts.\n\n5.          I certify that my appointment to the rank of Lieutenant USN\nhas not been previously withheld for any reason.\n                                              Delbert C. Newhouse\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - DELBERT C. NEWHOUSE - - - - - - - -\n3 April 1946                    FIRST ENDORSEMENT\n\n      From:       The Supply Officer in Command, Naval Aviation Supply Depot, Phila.\n      To:         The Chief of Naval Personnel.\n\n1.          Forwarded.\n\nBy direction of SOinC:\n                                              W. D. SAMS\n                                              [REDACTED]\n                                              Military Personnel Officer\n                                              PERS 32152\n                                         FINISHED FILE", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "ba423146c1865848b26ee7cdd68dfdc8693f784de35398edfe85b07bedd4056a", "output_sha256": "337314e9a9eab647160831