 Chief of Naval Personnel\nTo: LT Delbert C. NEWHOUSE, USN (RET)\n652 Burnham Street\nEl Cajon, California 92021\nVia:\n\n\n\n\nSubj: Awards; information concerning\n\nRef: (a) Your ltr of recent date\n\n\nEncl: (1) One medal\n\n1. An adjudication of your entitlement to certain awards has been made in response\nto reference (a). This adjudication encompassed ( ) all awards to which you are\nentitled; X ) only those awards indicated in reference (a).\n\nPERSONAL DECORATIONS | ELI- | FWD. | SEE | CAMPAIGN AND SERVICE MEDALS | ELI- | FWD. | SEE\n| GIBLE | | NOTE | | GIBLE | | NOTE\n\nAMERICAN DEFENSE SERVICE MEDAL\nFleet Clasp Base Clasp\nAMERICAN CAMPAIGN MEDAL\nEUROPEAN-AFRICAN-MIDDLE EASTERN\nCAMPAIGN MEDAL\nASIATIC-PACIFIC CAMPAIGN MEDAL\nWORLD WAR II VICTORY MEDAL\nNAVY OCCUPATION SERVICE MEDAL\nAsia Clasp Europe Clasp\nCHINA SERVICE MEDAL\nNATIONAL DEFENSE SERVICE MEDAL\nKOREAN SERVICE MEDAL\nOTHER AWARDS UNITED NATIONS SERVICE MEDAL\n\nNAVAL RESERVE MEDAL Armed Forces Expeditionary\nARMED FORCES RESERVE MEDAL Medal (Lebanon) X X\n\n\n\n\nCopy to: NRMC, NTC L. W. DUNTON, JR.\nBainbridge, Maryland By direction\nF4-24 (Rev. 9-63)", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "fca202a2c8296cb299ba651944d1f677bd8e090c8fec8f14863274081eec9e92", "output_sha256": "5b170a22fcf73da7843b2c452c4e8f3f15af589bdffb6bce7e4b042e390e93af", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:48:56.742208+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p467", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 467, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "EF-3# (68A' 6-93)\n\nHEADQUARTERS LEMHYRVR\nCOBA ROSHOC' SHE\n\nNOTE 1.  The records of this Bureau fail to establish your entitlement to this award.  If you have\n         evidence to substantiate your entitlement to the award in question, further consideration\n         will be given to your request upon submission of suc