essful operation in the supply support for photographic\nsupplies and equipment to the Pacific Ocean and Western Continental Areas. The high\nrate of efficiency and morale elicited from his subordinates is directly inspired by\nhis loyalty and cooperation. His quiet manner and dependability have gained the\nrespect of all who work with him. His character, both personal and military, is\nexcellent. He is recommended for promotion.\n\n\n12. NAME, GRADE, AND FILE NUMBER OF REPORTING OFFICER.  OFFICIAL STATUS RELATIVE TO OFFICER REPORTED ON.\nT. EARLE HIPP, RADM SC USN 15943   Commanding Officer\n\n                                                                                                c9-16-63843a-2", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "2db7c56a1477f50a7ba22f1c74e7868a5c3d5b310d0cc51d889129b2fa394fef", "output_sha256": "901d1b18685ae55f87d93ba74be04ef9fad999c472a16e3ccbaa20c32f804a2f", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T17:54:16.781342+00:00"}, {"id": "ca69163315f5ff40-p538", "card_id": "ca69163315f5ff40", "page": 538, "title": "DOW-UAP-D104, Final Personnel Record for Newhouse, Delbert C., U.S. Navy, 1957", "text": "13. TO WHAT DEGREE HAS THE OFFICER REPORTED ON EXHIBITED THE FOLLOWING QUALITIES?\n\n                          | NOT      | EXCEEDING              | EXCELLENT                 | EXCELLENT                 | UNSATIS-\n                          | OBSERVED |                        |                            |                            | FACTORY\n\n(a) INTELLIGENCE         |          | Exceptionally quick-witted;| Grasps essentials of a sit-| Understands normal situa-  |\n(With reference to the   |          | keen in understanding.    | uation quickly.            | tions and conditions.      |\nfaculty of com-          |          |                           |                            |                            |\nprehension; mental       |          |