Air Materiel Command Report on Unidentified Flying Objects, 1947-1948", "text": "HEADQUARTERS STRATEGIC AIR COMMAND          A2B\n             ANDREWS FIELD\n          WASHINGTON 20, D. C.\n\nSAC 350(2 Mar 48)                              2 March 1948\n\nSUBJECT:  Reporting of Information on Flying Discs.\n\n\nTO:       Chief of Staff\n          United States Air Force\n          Washington 25, D. C.\n          ATTN: Director of Intelligence\n\n\n     The attached copy of report pertaining to the above subject\nis forwarded in compliance with letter, USAF, subject as above,\n6 Feb 48.\n\n     FOR THE COMMANDING GENERAL:\n\n\n                              // MONTIE THOMPSON, JR.\n                                 1st Lt, USAF\n1 Incl  )Filed in OIR-CO         Assb Adj Gen\n  Rpt, subj: \"Smoking Object\"\n  26 Feb 48\n\n     No action necessary\n     File\n     Geo. D. Garrett, Jr.\n     Lt. Col. USAF\n            J.S.\n     Original to Central Files -\n     15 Mar 1948", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "45b44934f3ef950f296dd42043b9945c261894bd9bdc5b326d27547c19ad4c36", "output_sha256": "45b44934f3ef950f296dd42043b9945c261894bd9bdc5b326d27547c19ad4c36", "generated_at": "2026-08-08T04:01:32.151031+00:00"}, {"id": "da533c72f476d84f-p168", "card_id": "da533c72f476d84f", "page": 168, "title": "DOW-UAP-D100, Air Materiel Command Report on Unidentified Flying Objects, 1947-1948", "text": "HEADQUARTERS STRATEGIC AIR COMMAND\nANDREWS FIELD\nWASHINGTON 20, D. C.\n\nSAC 580(S Mar 48)                                    4 March 1948\n\nSUBJECT: Reporting of Information on Flying Discs.\n\nTO:    Chief of Staff\n       United States Air Force\n       Washington 25, D. C.\n       ATTN: Director of Intelligence\n\nThe attached copy of report pertaining to the above subject\nis forwarded in compliance with letter, USAF, subject as above,\nd/Ref AG.\n\nFOR THE COMMANDING GENER