t. Col Garrett/lwd/4544\n                                                    6 Feb 48\n                                                              6 Feb 48\n\n                    HEADQUARTERS\n                 AIR DEFENSE COMMAND\nIN REPLY           MITCHEL FIELD, NEW YORK\nREFER TO:       Mitchel Air Force Base, New York\n\nD 319.1 ID\n                                                    JAN 23 1948\n\n\nSUBJECT:  Transmittal of Intelligence Information.\n\nTO:       Chief of Staff, United States Air Force, Washington 25, D. C.\n          ATTENTION:  Directorate of Intelligence, Air Intelligence\n                      Requirements Division.\n\n\n          Inclosed herewith is a carbon copy of letter, Fourth Air Force,\nsubject as above, 6 January 1948, with 1 inclosure, for your information\nand file.\n\n                    FOR THE COMMANDING GENERAL:\n\n\n\n                                          R. H. SMITH\n                                          Colonel, USAF\n1 Incl.                                   AC/S-Intell.\n  Ltr, 4AF, subj:\n  \"Trans. of Intell.\n  Info,\" 6 Jan 48,\n  w/1 Incl.\n\n\nAFOIR-CO-5                    1st Ind.                    6 FEB 1948\n\nDept. of the Air Force, Hq. USAF, Washington 25, D. C.\n\nTO:  Commanding General, Air Materiel Command, Wright-Patterson Air\n     Force Base, Dayton, Ohio\n     ATTN:  TSDIN\n\n     Forwarded as a matter pertaining to your command.\n\nBY COMMAND OF THE CHIEF OF STAFF:\n                                          V319.21 Dissemination\n                         DOUGLASS W. EISEMAN  Includes Mte on\n                         Lt. Colonel, U.S.A.  Cover Sheet\n                         Executive, Air Intelligence Requirements Div.\n                         Directorate of Intelligence\n\n1 Incl.\n  n/e\n  w/orig copies\n\nCONFIDENTIAL", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "b21f4fa4ba5b62cc53c00571eac