Section_007", "text": "26 Olcott Street\nMaxi­ntown, Mass.\nMay 9, 1953\nThursday evening 9:25 PM\n\nDear Sir:\n\nI left school (M.I.T.) and\nentered the parking lot along side\nof the school. I happened to\nlook up and I saw what\nseems to be known as a flying\nsaucer. I assure you it was\nnot an air plane, a search light\nnor a falling star. It was round\nin shape & another name could\nfit it traveled horizontally at a\nrather slow speed for just a\nfew seconds. Then it disappeared,\njust like that. I was not alone\nat the time, another student was\n[REDACTED]\n\nyou his recorded to Recorded Days Jan 3 1953\n\nlike is 1 1800 99 80 1111 2 9 1953\n2\nwho are\nSoct-Massoury ser 20051 1/14/53 5/14/53 5/14/53\ncoto (and) = HM: 15 5/14/13", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "72835e54d029f5642153707ce01e1b5e35533b4541a0da3fbc35631d35ecce3d", "output_sha256": "7f5f5e52d08714ded53e8f47082c35e2471449966ef10eda42aa620a848b8eca", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:56:12.897134+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p148", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 148, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "on half have calling a D. of an For\nTraund appeations etc finally after\nSetting no arswers of called the\nwatertown police who muly informed\nme they didn't know what a should\ndo about it. It come as nother a\nsurgerge to me, I thought that\nAfrice was suppresed to be sombody\non lodeant of all temis. I do\nnot benow to whom I should write &\nin disparation an writing to you. I\ndo hope you will rigort this to the\nproper authorities for me and of hope\nyou will suggest to the local C.D.\nthat they should have somewhere\na someone that a proon could call\nto report such findings. I would appreciate\nvey much a reply from your. May\nA grist add, that I himstly dmil know\nand the unknown object was. I never\nbefore saw anything like it. I waited\nbe very happy to supply any ofthe of wife mother was much with the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the things of the t\nMrs. Robert W. Llaviss m\nBOLLEH db adau s\n1 8 1\n26 Watufaca Mass.", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "4fa59209b1b95dbf8f3cc0d6e626ebb84ba541f3d9fbc2d669a63a643a190528", "output_sha256": "4fa59209b1b95dbf8f3cc0d6e626ebb84ba541f3d9fbc2d669a63a643a190528", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:56:16.336401+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p149", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 149, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": ".\nJuly 9, 1953\n99-030KDED-09\n68 Mr. W. S. Woodfill\nINDEXED\nPresident\nGrand Hotel\nMackinac Island, Michigan\nDear Mr. Woodfill:\nYour letter of June 30, 1953, has been\nreceived in Mr. Hoover's absence from the city, and\nI am taking the liberty of acknowledging its receipt.\nYour communication will be brought to his\nattention promptly following his return to Washington.\nSincerely yours.\nOdgedown J. 17-5\nHelen W. Gandy\nSecretary\ncc-Detroit, with copy of incoming.\ncc-Cincinnati, with copy of incoming.\nATTENTION SAC: You are instructed to thoroughly\ncheck your files in an effort to determine whether\nor not the Mr. Stevenson referred to by correspondent\nhas been interviewed by an Agent of your office. You\nshould also furnish the Bureau any information which\nmight assist in clarifying the story set forth by\nWoodfill. Submit results no later than July 15, 1953\nunder caption \"Mr. W. S. Woodfill, President, Grand\nHotel, Mackinac Island, Michigan, Research (Crime\nFollow-up made for July 18, 1953. Will per Comment\nare being handled by the Air Force at this present\nTolson ____\ntime, it is believed desirable to check the source\nLadd____\nNichols ____\nof this rumor and following receipt of reply from\nBelmont -\nClegg __\nCincinnati, refer correspondent's inquiry to the Air Force.\nGlavin___\nIn 1939 and again in 1940 Woodfill invited the Director\nHarbo _____\nRosen ____\nto attend the Michigan Hotel Convention, and both invitations\nTracy____\nGearty ____\nwere declined. An informant reported that in 1945\nMohr ____\nWinterrowd ___\ngambling on Mackinac Island was reserved for the Grand\nTele. Room -\nCOMM - FB\nHolloman ---\nHotel.\nSizoo __\nMiss Gandy _\nJUL 1 0 1953\nMAILED 27", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "6851da31486894a426af741b46ab5030a01a2f4253dad0c648c86bb68252020f", "output_sha256": "22f391bab61cffcffb6b31ab03e09beafa95a8e99a4915e9b76eb6bb171aba82", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:56:18.861375+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p150", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 150, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "I appreciate your submission, but I must be honest about what I'm seeing in this document: the text is almost entirely garbled and incoherent. It appears to be severe OCR corruption affecting both English and Chinese characters, with repeated fragmented phrases, nonsensical number sequences, and completely scrambled passages.\n\nRather than make speculative \"corrections\" that might introduce false information into what should be a government document, I should note that this page is too corrupted for confident OCR error correction. The damage appears systematic—possibly from poor scan quality, severe image degradation, or column-detection failure affecting the entire page.\n\nIf this is from an actual declassified UAP document, I would recommend:\n1. Requesting a fresh scan of the original source material\n2. Checking if a better-quality version exists in the archive\n3. Having it re-scanned with improved settings\n\nI cannot responsibly \"clean\" text this severely compromised without risking fabrication of content.", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "e7079541561249c80120260584d767dd992d3ebfe8584f5b16537de6ea7c6130", "output_sha256": "65d028b050b23c5feb5af6ce4a3970d1fbb2b627a31cab19a27066ae5d86fc48", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:56:23.066031+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p151", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 151, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "Mr. Tolson\n0100150404450600280\nracy\nMr. Gearty\nMr. Mohr\nMICHIGAN\nWORLD'S LARGEST SUMMER HOTEL\nMACKINAC ISLAND\nMr. Helloman\nW. S. WOODFILL President\nMr. Sizoo\nJune 30, 1953\nMiss Gandy\nFederal Bureau of Investigation\nWashington, D. C.\nGentlemen:\nA relative of mine living in Circleville, Ohio has advised me of the following\naccount.\nTwo years ago a respected farmer living near Circleville saw a lighted object\ndancing around, flying around in the air near him late at night in a pasture\nor field, -- a flying saucer. In due time this came to have general knowledge\nin the community, and about one year ago the story appeared in the Circleville\nnewspaper.\nSince then he is presumed to have been consulted with representatives of the\nF.B.I., so it is said there, and only three weeks ago or so it is said the F.B.I.\nrepresentatives came to consult with him again. This time they brought pictures\nto show the farmer of various types of these flying saucers or space ships that\nhave been apprehended by the government from time to time, and the farmer was\nable to identify one of them as the type of thing he had seen two years ago.\nThe farmer was told, as the story goes, by your representatives, that the par-\nticular flying saucer he identified is the type that is known to have been flown\ndown from the planet Mars, and that similar ships have been captured, and that\nyour agency or the government hold captive one man at least in California who\nwas taken from one of these things from Mars. This Martian it is understood is\nnow being taught how to speak English -- in California -- and taught American\ncustoms. It is said that it is apparent that this Martian comes from a civilization\nmuch more advanced than our own civilization ... and that this account has general\nknowledge as reported here in that community.\nI understand that the farmer is a Mr. Stevenson, that he is held in very high\nrepute in the community, prosperous, conservative and of presumed sound mind.\n62-83 894 33\n11 15\nRECORDED = .68\nJUL 13 1953\n68", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "625feb4615000be8af5b269df5785a4b6f4a390959bfc91c5c2aeb04a3431443", "output_sha256": "3a0db2e32c9771ee3e1fbbb95803444116e7274341197a1a85997ec65411d5d9", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:56:26.170797+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p152", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 152, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "THE RESERVE OF THE PARTY OF\nTHE PERSON NAMED IN CO.\nen la la la la la la la la la la la la la\nThe state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of t\nMARKET CONTROL OF A TOP AND A PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE\n\nTHE RESERVE OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF THE PARTY OF\nthe sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sale of the sa\n\nOL OF\nU.S. DEPT\nRECE\nthe first the first transfer to the first transfer or the first transfer to the first transfer to the first transfer to the first transfer to the first transfer to the first transfer to the first transfer to the first tran\n9\nThe state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of the state of t\nCONTRACTOR OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF THE PROPERTY OF\n0\nbut I de l'in a stage del la responsable del la la la la la la la la la la la la la\n9.00\nw.\n\nMY 53\nLICHOLS\n\nTOP OF THE MEDICE\nn & OED\nH\nEG. HOOT\nRECEIVED\n111\nEZ. 49 18 1.\nШ\nJONES\nU.S. DEPT. OF JUSTICE\nB\n301\nRECEIVED - DIRECTOR\nEG. HY ET OI\nJULEUL DE JUSTICE\nJUL 10\n9 36 AM 353\nROTOBRIO - OBVISCENDR\n3011801 40 1430'S TO\n13\nRECEIVED - DIRECTOR", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "9a277bf39c1ec839179a9f4011324b6ccc43e56c4f69f1ca9c53a68095954268", "output_sha256": "f4092c02199037b2dce96bcfe8e9996346df5f9f266e36cb07017dc0519db7b1", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:56:28.858697+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p153", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 153, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "No. 2\nI can only believe that the account is a lot of nonsense, insofar as the F.B.I.\ntelling the farmer that the government has captured several \"flying saucers\",\nand that they are from Mars, and that a Martian is being held captive in California.\nIt would be apparent to me that if the government did have such knowledge, they\nwould not confide such information to the farmer, -- and moreover that it is too\nutterly fantastic to credit with recognition as true. The farmer no doubt saw\na \"flying saucer\", a light reflection or other light phenomenon such as the government has said all such things really are, and not a space ship from Mars or any other\nplace in outer space.\nI am writing to hopefully secure your advice, insofar as you can properly advise\nme publicly as a citizen, of what the truth is in this story. I should like to\nset my relative there straight. And I am curious personally to know what the real\nstory is about this farmer - Mr. Stevenson of the Circleville, Ohio area.\nRespectfully yours,\nPresident", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "289f6fa6794489e2b25522af42fd447d5e13e8ce1d24460178a94b7b6cca7ae6", "output_sha256": "856d4ca04ad1b33751baa60e900d3edf1e3c79f47832aa56ffffef9a9dc39907", "generated_at": "2026-05-11T13:43:06.369808+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p154", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 154, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "FEDERAL BUREAU OF INVESTIGATION\nU. S. DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE\nCOMMUNICATIONS SECTION\nMr. Hall\nMr. Rosen\nJUL\n1953\nMr. Tracy\nMr. Gearty\nMr. Mahr\nMr. Winterrowd\nTele. Room\nMr. Holloman\nMr. Sizoo\nGandy\nFBI ATLANTA\n11-0-2 AM\n7-8-53\nJB\nURGENT\nDIRECTOR, FBI\nFLYING SAUCERS, MR. TOM MCRAE, - ATLANTA CONSTITUTION- REPORTER,\nCOMPLAINANT. THREE FORTYFIVE AM THIS DATE MCRAE TELEPHONICALLY FURNISHED\nFOLLOWING -FANTASTIC TALE - ASSURING THAT NEITHER HE NOR ANY MEMBER\nOF - CONSTITUTION- STAFF HAD BEEN DRINKING BUT HAD WITNESSED THIS\nSTORY. MCRAE STATED EDWARD E. WATERS, ONE EIGHT FIVE FIVE PEACHTREE\nRD. NE. TELE ELGIN NINE FIVE SIX TWO, CALLED ON HIM AT NEWSPAPER OFFICE\nSTATING HE AND TWO OTHER COMPANIONS WHILE TRAVELING IN CAR ON BANKHEAD HIGHWAY ABOUT MABLETON, GA. ENCOUNTERED THREE SMALL ANIMALS WHICH\nTHEY BELIEVED HAD LANDED