oes\nINDEXED - 79\nnot relate to a matter within the jurisdiction of the\nFBI.\nYou may desire, however, to communicate\nwith The Honorable, The Secretary of the Air Force,\nThe Pentagon, Washington 25, D. C., for whatever\ninformation he can give you.\nSincerely yours,\nJ. Edgar Hoover\nJohn Edgar Hoover\nDirector\nNOTE: First name salutation is being used since the\ncorrespondent indicates she is a seventh grade student.\nShe requested the Director's opinion regarding Flying Saucers.\nPR 27\nRECEIVED\nST.\nGEM: ew\nCFS\nTolson _\nLadd_\nBOILS\nNichols_\nREADING ROOM\nBelmont _\n3 45\nCU\nClegg_\nGlavin_\nRELIDE\nHarbo_\nRosen_\n15. Hd\nTracy_\nMUUN\nGearty_\nMohr_\nRECE\nCOMM\nWinterrowd __\nFBI\nweek\nTele. Room\nHolloman ____\nMiss Gandy _\nAPR 2 8 1954\nMAILED 31", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "ac828bb32ab104d9f2983b60abe4528b3eb810f2368db9444ff19fe8ee9b90e9", "output_sha256": "a84acfda59cc9dca5cb8a38366a61aedd1b88942a15ea7ced2c33daf73ecb40b", "generated_at": "2026-05-25T13:58:25.823862+00:00"}, {"id": "f85532f0514320be-p188", "card_id": "f85532f0514320be", "page": 188, "title": "65_HS1-834228961_62-HQ-83894_Section_007", "text": "This document appears to be severely corrupted OCR output containing a mixture of:\n- Random Chinese characters\n- Garbage text and formatting artifacts\n- Partial English words and fragments\n- Stray numbers and symbols\n- What appears to be a scan of multiple overlapping or misaligned pages\n\nThe content is too severely garbled to reliably distinguish between OCR errors and actual document content. The text does not form coherent sentences in either English or Chinese, and attempting to \"correct\" it would require making assumptions about what the original document actually contained.\n\nGiven the level of corruption, the most honest approach is to preserve it as-is, since any \"corrections\" would be speculative:\n\nEF