-2A2\n\n                                         OCT 3  1952\n\nMrs. Victoria Jackson\n633 East 5th South\nProvo, Utah\n   Dear\n      Mrs. Jackson:\n         Your recent letter concerning unidentified flying\n\nobjects has been received by this Headquarters, and\n\nthe ideas which you submitted are receiving our\n\ncareful consideration.\n\n         We appreciate your interest and efforts to assist\n\nus.  X095. Jackson, Mrs. Victoria\n\n                              Sincerely,\n\n\n                         S\n                         WILLIAM A. ADAMS\n                         Colonel, USAF\n                         Chief, Topical Division\n                         Deputy Director for Estimates\n                         Directorate of Intelligence, DCS/O\n\nCOORDINATION:  AFOIN-2A2    AFOIN-2A\n\n      [ILLEGIBLE signature]       [ILLEGIBLE signature]\n               [ILLEGIBLE]", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "3bd74b3421c6f5377644eda763d2cbeb06b3a9001c531a01de5e990d7aae8792", "output_sha256": "3bd74b3421c6f5377644eda763d2cbeb06b3a9001c531a01de5e990d7aae8792", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T18:09:04.699145+00:00"}, {"id": "fec5b139eb7b0a4f-p112", "card_id": "fec5b139eb7b0a4f", "page": 112, "title": "DOW-UAP-D105, U.S. Air Force Flying Discs File, 1952", "text": "Saucers - from Where?\n\n     For his advanced teachings in science; philosophy; astrology, the existence of other peopled planets etc., Joseph Smith the Mormon prophet was martyred.\n     He also said that this earth's people were least advanced of those other dwellers\n     Why then should not planetary people excel in making space vehicles, strange and marvelous, & come to look us over for reasons they best know?\n     Although comparatively few of the ten \"Lost Tribes of Israel\" were scattered among Scandinavian & other countries, Joseph Smith said that the main portion were taken to a foreign planet, & would some time return to earth. Can it be that they are now scouting over us?\n     If it be true, what skeptics say, that the increasing amount of such visitors are the results of some people's hallucinations, etc. then its full time that something be done about this fast growing", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "aea8c1cd58f9ad4912fa59c74aa8aeb5c29ed9f802e9f6f250e0848bae758187", "output_sha256": "21023e19985a5af4a2a2a2f23e4ade26e531dcab7992cd65d8b533e17e40689f", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T18:09:05.892436+00:00"}, {"id": "fec5b139eb7b0a4f-p113", "card_id": "fec5b139eb7b0a4f", "page": 113, "title": "DOW-UAP-D105, U.S. Air Force Flying Discs File, 1952", "text": "Saucers from Where?\n2\n\nrelapse in mentality and eyesight\nbefore humanity goes mad.\n   It couldn't be, could it, that there is\nsomething lacking in the reasoning power\nof those who thus judge their fellow\ncreatures? If so, then Bible prophecies\nmust be coming true concerning such\nlatter day unnatural tendencies.\n   We understand that, along with so many ex-\nplanations about the saucers, a man has invented\na way of making such things apparent to the\npublic. I think it will be hard to convince\nmany saucer spectators, that what they saw\nwere make-believe.\n   The news analyst, Gabriel Heatter, asks\nwhy these saucers are over America and\nnot over Europe. If those visitors are\nthe lost tribes, then they must be preparing\ntheir return to earth as Joseph Smith predicted.\n\n      Mrs. Victoria Jackson\n         Provo Utah.", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "prompt_sha256": "a59e30285339eb18324e5a8552f80926750818af40043cd98315ffdb8087398f", "input_sha256": "1ba745b9180aa09d5bdf61e9bd55fe88f8a7a9c46b8d8852a8bd282250d630b3", "output_sha256": "892b39625dc76aadb18a07107734673fba5bbc97d9d2653a4c6e4e898438e8c2", "generated_at": "2026-09-19T18:09:06.982333+00:00"}, {"id": "fe